  "project_description": "Synopsis \n Log viewer for your web server.\n\n With this module you can have access to events logged by the Syslog module.\n\n Requirements \n Syslog module have to use a specific file for the Drupal log and this file has to be readable by the webserver user.\n\n Configuration \n Configure in Administration » Configuration » Development » Logging and errors :\n\n \n Define which file to read. \n If you have changed the separator used on the syslog format, you also have to configure it. \n \n Similar modules \n \n Syslog Viewer (D6): \n\nissue to merge with Syslog Viewer [#2849422] \n \n Maintainers \n \n Benjamin Rambaud (beram) \n Florent Torregrosa (Grimreaper) \n Back to top",
